summary:
  The start never sweeps the buffer directory a crashed session left behind.

history:
  Seen on the bench 2026-09-23 before the fix: after the host was killed,
  the next start left the writer running and its pid file, url file and
  buffer where they were. A writer from before the guard existed, and every
  buffer a dead session leaves, are only ever cleared by the start.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          timeshift.startup(Date.now());

replace:
          ;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_buffer_sweep_runs_before_anything_else_the_start_does.
  Line-neutral.
